   ((name . exchange-windows!) (module minde frames) (signature . "(exchange-windows! arg-1)") (documentation . "Swaps the current window with the one shown in the frame in direction\nDIR (StumpWM exchange-direction). With an empty neighbor this is just a\nmove; focus follows the current window."))
   ((name . expose-enter!) (module minde frames) (signature . "(expose-enter!)") (documentation . "Saves the live layout and tiles this head's windows one per frame in\na labeled grid. Returns the window count, or #f when there are no windows.\nRepeated entry restores the previous snapshot first. Saved layouts belong\nto their group and head. Callers arm the pick keymap."))
