   ((name . split-frame-horizontal!) (module minde frames) (signature . "(split-frame-horizontal!)") (documentation . "Splits the current frame into two side-by-side frames (a vertical\ndividing line). The current window (if any) stays in the left frame, which\nbecomes the new current frame."))
